## Worksheet

**F1 Core loop**: `GameState` single state object; `PRNG` (mulberry32-style) drives all `rng.next/randInt/pick` calls; `endTurn()` runs numbered steps 1-9 in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 Map**: 64-tile grid via `generateMap()` using `rng.pick(TERRAINS)`; `canBuildAt` checks terrain; `adjacencyBonus` multiplies `output` in `calculateProduction`. Score 2.

**F3 Economy**: `bldg.consumes`/`bldg.produces` gives single-hop conversions (ore→metal); no genuine 2-hop chain exists (ash never produced by anything, soil never consumed). Caps/overflow handled in `endTurn`. Score 1.

**F4 Population**: colonists carry `skill,fatigue,morale,job`; `skill`/`fatigue`/`morale` read in `calculateProduction`; `job` read in skill-growth branch (`c.job==='farm'`). Score 2.

**F5 Needs**: per-turn `foodNeed/waterNeed` consumption in `endTurn`; shortage does `c.morale -= 10`; `moraleFactor` used in production; morale recovers via unassigned-colonist branch (+3/turn). Score 2.

**F6 Research**: 8 `RESEARCH_NODES`; `canResearch` enforces prereqs; `doResearch` deducts cost; but `morale` and `advpropulsion` nodes have no effect anywhere (`applyResearch`/`triggerAshstorm` never reference them). Score 1.

**F7 Events**: 12 `EVENTS`; weighted pick in `fireEvent`; 7 events have 2 choices with distinct outcome branches in `resolveEventChoice`; `eventCooldowns[event.name]=turn+5` enforced in filter. Score 2.

**F8 Trade**: price uses `inventoryFactor` from `game.resources[res]/STORAGE_CAPS[res]`; only a Buy button exists (no Sell anywhere); Buy never decrements `caravanInventory`, so it's not actually limited. Score 1.

**F9 Hazard**: `triggerAshstorm` fires every ≥7 turns, severity scales with `turn`, `tile.damage` reduces `output` in `calculateProduction`, `shieldtech` reduces damage — but no repair function exists anywhere, damage never decreases. Score 1.

**F10 Save/load**: `.textarea-input`/`.save-load-section` CSS exists but no tab, button, serialize-to-text, or import/parse code found anywhere in JS. Score 0.

**F11 End conditions**: win/lose both checked in `endTurn` step 9 (`turn>=61` branch, `colonists.length===0`); `renderEndScreen` computes `totalScore` from population/research/food/water/turns. Score 2.

**F12 UI**: tab switching via `.tab-button` listeners; log lines prefixed `[T${turn}]`; keyboard shortcuts (`Space`, `Digit1-5`) wired; responsive `@media(max-width:600px)`; but `.tooltip` CSS class is never applied anywhere in JS (only native `title` attr). Score 1.

**F13 Dev panel**: `runTests()` has 15 real invariant checks (caps, bounds, prereqs, PRNG determinism); `runBenchmark()` runs 200 headless `endTurn()` calls and prints `stateHash()`. Score 2.

**G1**: `applyResearch()` multiplies `prod.metal`/`prod.food` from `alloy`/`hydroponics`, called every `endTurn`; but `ashharv` doubles `prod.ash` which no building ever produces (dead branch). Score 3.

**G2**: shortage sets `c.morale -= 10` in `endTurn`; `moraleFactor = c.morale/100` used directly in `calculateProduction` output formula every turn. Score 4.

**G3**: `triggerAshstorm` sets `tile.damage`; `calculateProduction` subtracts `tile.damage*0.3` from output; but no repair function exists anywhere — damage never decreases, no resource cost to fix. Score 2.

**G4**: trade price formula reads `game.resources[res]/STORAGE_CAPS[res]` every render of `renderTradeTab`; `globalPriceDrift` initialized but never mutated (dead). Score 3.

**G5**: `Equipment Failure` choices `costParts` vs `gainScrip` mutate different resources; `Medical Emergency` choices `costFood` vs `loseColonist` (splices colonist array) — both durable, non-log-only mutations. Score 4.

